{"skill":{"slug":"feishu","displayName":"Feishu"},"version":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1773221599853,"changelog":"Version 1.0.5\n\n- 引入了“协作诊断层”，明确先对协作摩擦类型进行识别与分层诊断，强调优先判断再行动。\n- 增加对错误动作（如上下文缺失、过早提醒、盲目更新、错层处理、升级漂移）的默认风险提示机制。\n- 文档大幅优化并重组，提升对“最佳动作”和风险压制的逻辑阐述。\n- 进一步细化交互逻辑，确保动作前须有诊断、建议与多重确认。\n- 版本号升级，保持与最新能力结构一致。","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"README.md","size":1603,"sha256":"f309046f04d5b37e9e6748de10efed36169a76f99e899422d9a2d14d14a02214","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"examples.md","size":916,"sha256":"d7a009ef2a49ae993ef3f85aabcddb41eea1f809ebc9f6484d8aa6bf7268f400","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill.json","size":1672,"sha256":"4a1b42b1d85644912c890cc195d9f0466ed315b22934d1d52bd1e221d787dd16","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill.md","size":19544,"sha256":"b69f2fe72198e051132a725e2a7ce48bf0433050c4ccb6c8a065dc1a7f32b54b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2818,"sha256":"cd8eea3814a1fe511e59fda985a87461fdaf1ffdc67c59cc242dcd86b699a61f","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789121078020,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7d38117cdfbf36c54c9d1f590b00da9de5b537b46c1a1ee0cf1b42b351e9ded6","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7d38117cdfbf36c54c9d1f590b00da9de5b537b46c1a1ee0cf1b42b351e9ded6","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085809977},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":22,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789121078020},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed Feishu workflow assistant that requests broad but purpose-aligned workplace integration and includes clear confirmation boundaries for writes.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Recommended Feishu connector scopes include reading and sending messages plus reading approvals, tables, meetings, calendars, and org information; these are proportionate to the feature set, but users should grant the minimum scopes needed.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact is instruction-only Markdown/JSON with no install scripts, binaries, executable files, or bundled network code; the manifest declares only FEISHU_APP_ID and FEISHU_APP_SECRET environment requirements.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions require a first-use mode handshake, default to read-only counselor mode, require explicit confirmation for writes, and require secondary confirmation for sensitive actions such as leader messages, public cross-department reminders, core table edits, approval decisions, and irreversible calendar changes.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill states it does not persist credentials, defines no external reporting endpoint, relies on host-provided runtime credentials, and contains no instructions for background workers, memory writes, hooks, or cross-session persistence.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill is designed to summarize and coordinate Feishu messages, approvals, meetings, documents, tables, schedules, and org context; that is broad workplace access, but it is coherent with the stated digital command-center purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only with a Feishu app whose scopes match what you actually need. Start in counselor mode for read-only summaries and drafts, and use executive mode only when you are comfortable allowing confirmed actions such as sending messages, editing tables, or coordinating schedules.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: Chinese-language examples are consistent with the disclosed Feishu and China-enterprise audience; this is a locale focus rather than hidden behavior or security-relevant manipulation.\n[SQP-1] expected: Some triggers such as meeting minutes and weekly reports are generic workplace terms, but they map to the stated Feishu workflows and are mitigated by the required handshake, context checks, and confirmation-before-write rules.\n[SQP-3] expected: The manifest audience is explicitly China-enterprise oriented, matching the skill description and runtime guidance; no artifact evidence shows forced unsafe locale behavior beyond that disclosed scope.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The supplied SARIF reports no T01-T09 security results, which aligns with inspection showing no executable scripts, remote payload retrieval, credential persistence, or tool hijacking instructions.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789121078020}}}}}